WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.072
Request instructor assessment.

00:00:02.072 --> 00:00:10.290
After completing the adult core and practice activities, ask a qualified instructor to schedule a practical assessment.

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:15.331
The current learner interface does not submit that request automatically.

00:00:15.331 --> 00:00:23.963
An instructor may approve the practical sign-off or return focused remediation; self-completion cannot replace that decision.
